{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会の私服  黒い孤独ver."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嫌われ松子の一生の黒い孤独篇に合わせて真っ黒の私服にしたよーっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2016/10/03/0601392/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2016/10/03/0601392/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2つめの私服"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2016/10/03/0601392/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2016/10/03/0601392/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会いに来てくれて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうーっヽ(*´∀｀)八(´∀｀*)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京喰種:reの新巻の話とか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全国ツアーの感想や二科展についてなど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色々お話しできて楽しかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さっそくの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台の感想も嬉しかったよーっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"観て良かった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感動した！深かった！って声をきくと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あぁーもっと頑張ろう！伝えよう！って思えるの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなからの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"優しさと応援が何より力になっています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に ありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お芝居をやらせてもらうと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分の真面目さが嫌になり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"曲線を描きたい、突発性の力が欲しい、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな風に思うことがよくあります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はそういう風にしか生きられないから..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だったらそこが自分の強みに出来る気持ちを持たないと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"勤勉に努力を重ねる事は必ず力になる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから自分なりに固める。結論をまとめる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まとめ上がったそれらを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後はぶっ壊したいですね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"赤い熱情の松子も黒い孤独の松子も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"劇場で全力で生きようと足掻いています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"赤い熱情の松子はかっこいい、美しい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"弱さを隠す為の尖る強さが逆に儚げである。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"黒い孤独の松子は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんな松子に見えるのか、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑顔で孤独を隠し...明るく振る舞おうとする"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも ふと窮地になった時 どうしても人間としての弱さが垣間見えて怒ったり叫んだり...泣いたり...縋り付く。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大き過ぎて強すぎる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"愛と優しさが 人を壊してしまう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな松子が好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...松子は綺麗な人間だ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2016/10/03/0601392/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は マチソワ."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"千秋楽まで 頑張ります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"台風...か...皆様気をつけて。"}],"source":"archive"}